<h1>Introduction to Volleyball</h1>

<p><strong>Volleyball</strong> is a dynamic and fast-paced team sport played between two teams of six players each, separated by a net. The aim is to score points by sending the ball over the net and landing it in the opponent’s court.</p>

<div class="highlight">
  <p>Volleyball requires agility, teamwork, quick reflexes, and strong communication skills.</p>
</div>

<h2><span class="emoji">🏐</span>Basic Rules of Volleyball</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Each team has 6 players on the court.</li>
  <li>A rally begins with a serve and continues until the ball touches the ground, goes out of bounds, or a fault is committed.</li>
  <li>Teams can touch the ball a maximum of 3 times before sending it over the net.</li>
  <li>The same player cannot touch the ball twice in a row (except for blocking).</li>
  <li>A match is typically played as best of 5 sets. The first team to 25 points (with at least a 2-point lead) wins a set.</li>
</ul>

<h2><span class="emoji">🧍‍♀️</span>Player Positions</h2>

<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Position</th>
    <th>Role</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Setter</strong></td>
    <td>Sets up the ball for attackers, acts like the "playmaker"</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Outside Hitter</strong></td>
    <td>Attacks from the front-left, also helps in defense</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Middle Blocker</strong></td>
    <td>Specializes in blocking and quick hits near the net</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Opposite Hitter</strong></td>
    <td>Attacks from the right and supports the setter</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Libero</strong></td>
    <td>Defensive specialist, cannot attack or serve, wears a different jersey</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2><span class="emoji">💥</span>Key Skills</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Serving:</strong> Starting the play by hitting the ball over the net</li>
  <li><strong>Passing:</strong> Receiving the ball and directing it to the setter</li>
  <li><strong>Setting:</strong> Placing the ball for an attacker to spike</li>
  <li><strong>Spiking:</strong> Powerfully hitting the ball into the opponent's court</li>
  <li><strong>Blocking:</strong> Preventing the ball from crossing the net during a spike</li>
  <li><strong>Digging:</strong> Defending against a spike by diving or using reflexes</li>
</ul>

<h2><span class="emoji">⚖️</span>Common Violations</h2>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Violation</th>
    <th>Description</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Net Touch</strong></td>
    <td>Touching the net during play is not allowed</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Foot Fault</strong></td>
    <td>Stepping over the service line during a serve</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Double Hit</strong></td>
    <td>Same player touches the ball twice in succession</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Carry</strong></td>
    <td>Ball is held or thrown rather than hit cleanly</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2><span class="emoji">🌍</span>Popular Competitions</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>FIVB Volleyball World Championship</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Olympic Volleyball Tournament</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Volleyball Nations League (VNL)</strong></li>
  <li><strong>National Collegiate Athletic Association (NCAA)</strong> – USA</li>
</ul>

<h2><span class="emoji">🧠</span>Concept Check</h2>
<ul>
  <li>How many players are on a volleyball team?</li>
  <li>What is the role of a Libero?</li>
  <li>What is the maximum number of touches per team before sending the ball over?</li>
</ul>

<h2><span class="emoji">💡</span>Summary</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Volleyball is a team sport where players aim to score by grounding the ball on the opponent’s court.</li>
  <li>It emphasizes coordination, timing, and strategic play.</li>
  <li>Learning positions, rotations, and core skills is key to effective play.</li>
</ul>

<div class="highlight">
  <p>Practice Tip: Start with basic passing and serving drills with a friend or against a wall to improve your control!</p>
</div>
<div id="live-file-panel" style="display:none;margin:20px 0;padding:16px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;background:#f9f9f9;">
  <strong>Live File</strong>
  <div id="live-file-content" style="margin-top:8px;color:#555;"></div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  const parts = window.location.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean);
  const apiBase = 'http://172.31.184.39:8000';
  let course = '', week = '';
  if(parts.length >= 3 && parts[0] === 'courses'){
    course = parts[1];
    week = parts[2];
  } else if(parts.length >= 2 && parts[0] !== 'courses'){
    course = parts[0];
    week = parts[1];
  } else {
    return;
  }
  course = course.trim();
  week = week.trim();
  if(!course || !week) return;
  const panel = document.getElementById('live-file-panel');
  const content = document.getElementById('live-file-content');
    function renderFile(meta){
    if(!meta){
      panel.style.display = 'none';
      return;
    }
    const url = apiBase + '/live-file/' + course + '/' + week;
    const dlUrl = url + '?download=1';
    const type = meta.content_type || '';
    const safeName = meta.filename || 'file';
    let html = '<div><a href="' + dlUrl + '" style="color:#2572F5;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;">Download ' + safeName + '</a></div>';
    if(type.startsWith('image/')){
      fetch(url).then(r=>r.blob()).then(b=>{
        const el = document.getElementById('live-file-img');
        if(el) el.src = URL.createObjectURL(b);
      });
      html += '<div style="margin-top:10px;"><img id="live-file-img" src="" alt="' + safeName + '" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;"/></div>';
    } else if(type === 'application/pdf'){
      fetch(url).then(r=>r.blob()).then(b=>{
        const el = document.getElementById('live-file-iframe');
        if(el) el.src = URL.createObjectURL(b);
      });
      html += '<div style="margin-top:10px;"><iframe id="live-file-iframe" src="" style="width:100%;height:480px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;"></iframe></div>';
    } else if(type.startsWith('text/')){
      fetch(url).then(r=>r.blob()).then(b=>{
        const el = document.getElementById('live-file-iframe');
        if(el) el.src = URL.createObjectURL(b);
      });
      html += '<div style="margin-top:10px;"><iframe id="live-file-iframe" src="" style="width:100%;height:320px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;"></iframe></div>';
    }
    content.innerHTML = html;
    panel.style.display = 'block';
  }
  async function load(){
    try{
      const r = await fetch(apiBase + '/admin/live-file/' + course + '/' + week);
      if(!r.ok){renderFile(null);return;}
      const d = await r.json();
      renderFile(d || null);
    }catch{
      renderFile(null);
    }
  }
  load();
  setInterval(load, 15000);
})();
</script>
